sentences.l:
and counsellor Zeus heard him,
and at once he thundered from light-filled Olympus,
from on high, out of the clouds;

“Father Zeus, you who rule over gods and men,
truly greatly have you thundered from starry heaven,
and nowhere is there a cloud;

“Come, some of you sweep the house, bustling about,
and sprinkle it, and on the well-made chairs carpets
throw, purple ones;

and others with sponges the tables
all wipe round, and cleanse the mixing-bowls
and the double cups, well-wrought;

They, then,
well and skilfully split wood, and the women
came from the spring;

Altogether, no longer I think we two will be parted
before of hands we taste, since you indeed not in due order
beg;
